Deki Tiled Map Editor Integration
Copyright (c) 2026 Deki Engine

This module integrates with Tiled Map Editor (https://www.mapeditor.org),
authored by Thorbjørn Lindeijer and contributors. Tiled is GPL-licensed but
this module only consumes Tiled's exported file formats (.tmj/.tsj) and is
not derived from Tiled source code.

Editor-side decompression of base64+zlib chunk data uses miniz
(https://github.com/richgel999/miniz), MIT licensed.
